# Context is the parent of the repository (see Dockerfile), so every pattern
# here is relative to that directory and has to survive two sibling checkouts
# rather than one. `target/` in particular is gigabytes of host-architecture
# artefacts that the builder stage would have to ship across the daemon socket
# and then ignore.
**/target
**/.git

# Agent tooling state and editor droppings: never inputs to a build.
**/.omc
**/.omx
**/.DS_Store

# Sibling projects that are no part of this build.
ramjet-ws-js

# Not source, and changing one should not invalidate the build cache.
ramjet-ingress/Dockerfile
ramjet-ingress/.dockerignore
ramjet-ingress/deploy
ramjet-ingress/bench
**/*.md

# The runtime's own test rigs and fixtures; `src/`, `ramjet-http/` and the
# manifests are what cargo actually reads.
enhance-socket/bench
enhance-socket/autobahn
enhance-socket/certs
enhance-socket/scripts
